claimed. Native append body, SQL signatures and catalog queries reviewed.
maximum_operations is validated above the reservation but not decremented in this body;
source-unit size is checked but no receipt construction consumes its value here. SQL
comments describe projection witnessing not established by this body: session_observe is
defined but uncalled. Centroid, trajectory and budget allocator internals remain separate.
